#: Advanced.md:1
msgid "Advanced implementation"
msgstr "高度な実装"

#: Advanced.md:3
msgid ""
"I am assuming that you have at least read the [base "
"version](Implementation.md) of the implementation procedure."
msgstr "実装手順の [基本版](Implementation.md) を少なくとも読んでいることを前提とします。"

#: Advanced.md:5
msgid "Here I will introduce a few much more advanced concepts:"
msgstr "さらに高度な概念を紹介します。"

#: Advanced.md:7
msgid ""
"the link cells algorithm, as described by Allen, and as implemented in "
"plumed in the LinkCells class (you can get it with `\"#include "
"\"plumed/tools/LinkCells.h\"`)"
msgstr ""
"Allen が説明し、PLUMED の LinkCells Class に実装された Link Cells アルゴリズム（`\"#include "
"\"plumed/tools/LinkCells.h\"` で利用）。"

#: Advanced.md:8
msgid "What is the shared memory in Cuda"
msgstr "CUDA の Shared Memory。"

#: Advanced.md:10
msgid "How does LinkCells work?"
msgstr "LinkCells の仕組み"

#: Advanced.md:12
msgid ""
"The `LinkCells` algorithm is similar to the `NeighborList` one, but the list"
" of neighbors will be shared by a group of atoms. In a few words: every _N_ "
"steps, typically `N==1`, the following algorithm is run:"
msgstr ""
"`LinkCells` は `NeighborList` に似ていますが、原子群で Neighbor の一覧を共有します。_N_ Step ごと、通常は"
" `N==1` で次を行います。"

#: Advanced.md:15
msgid "Divide the simulation box into cells"
msgstr "Box を Cell に分割する。"

#: Advanced.md:16
msgid "Assign each atom to the cell in which it is contained"
msgstr "各原子を、それが含まれる Cell に割り当てる。"

#: Advanced.md:17
msgid ""
"Determine the list of “neighbor” cells for each cell (the adjacent ones, "
"also in diagonal, for example, in the image below, for `6` are `1 2 3 5 7 9 "
"10 11`), in 3D, the neighbor cells will be 26 -or fewer if the box is sliced"
" into fewer boxes-"
msgstr ""
"各 Cell の Neighbor Cell（斜めも含む隣接 Cell）を決める。下図で `6` なら `1 2 3 5 7 9 10 "
"11`。3次元では26個、分割数が少なければそれ以下になる。"

#: Advanced.md:18
msgid ""
"Assign to each cell the _candidate neighbors_ atoms by merging the list of "
"atoms of the central cell and the ones of the neighbors cells."
msgstr "中心と隣接 Cell の原子一覧を統合し、各 Cell に _Candidate Neighbors_ を割り当てる。"

#: Advanced.md:20
msgid ""
"For example in the image below all the atoms in cell `6` share the list of "
"_candidate neighbors_ that are the atoms contained in the e `1 2 3 5 6 7 9 "
"10 11` cells."
msgstr ""
"下図の Cell `6` の全原子は、`1 2 3 5 6 7 9 10 11` 内の原子を _Candidate Neighbors_ "
"として共有します。"

#: Advanced.md:22
msgid ""
"In this way for collection of atoms assigned to a specific cell we will have"
" a shared neighbors list. Thil will be used to make the GPU process less "
"data and to save some memory."
msgstr "各 Cell の原子群が Neighbor List を共有し、GPU の処理データと Memory を減らせます。"

#: Advanced.md:25
msgid "![](./grid.svg)"
msgstr "![](./grid.svg)"

#: Advanced.md:27
msgid "Shared memory in Cuda"
msgstr "CUDA の Shared Memory"

#: Advanced.md:29
msgid ""
"The shared memory in Cuda is a (small) portion of memory that is shared "
"between the threads in a group of a kernel. It acts as a sort of level 3 "
"cache for those kernels, so that accessing the data in the shared memory is "
"significantly faster than accessing the data in the RAM of the GPU."
msgstr ""
"Shared Memory は Kernel の Group 内の Thread が共有する小さな Memory 領域です。Level 3 Cache "
"のように働き、GPU RAM より大幅に高速にアクセスできます。"

#: Advanced.md:31
msgid ""
"Moreover, you can build the shared memory in order to access it in a less "
"sparse way than you would access the standard RAM. This “massage” of the "
"memory is a small tradeoff and usually ends up giving a huge advantage in "
"speed."
msgstr "通常の RAM より疎でないアクセスになるよう配置を工夫できます。小さな処理コストで、通常は大きな高速化が得られます。"

#: Advanced.md:33
msgid "Running the coordination with LinkCells"
msgstr "LinkCells による Coordination の実行"

#: Advanced.md:35
msgid ""
"Now I will explain a simplified version of the CudaCoordination "
"implementation that will be shipped with PLUMED v2.11."
msgstr "PLUMED v2.11 に含まれる CudaCoordination を簡略化して説明します。"

#: Advanced.md:37
msgid "We want to do a few things:"
msgstr "次を行います。"

#: Advanced.md:39
msgid "On the CPU:"
msgstr "CPU 上："

#: Advanced.md:40
msgid "We calculate the linkCells"
msgstr "LinkCells を計算する。"

#: Advanced.md:41
msgid "We assign the addresses of the atoms to the various cells"
msgstr "原子の Address を各 Cell に割り当てる。"

#: Advanced.md:42
msgid ""
"We create the _candidate neighbors_ list for each cell and we store it on "
"the CPU"
msgstr "各 Cell の _Candidate Neighbors_ を作り、CPU に保存する。"

#: Advanced.md:43
msgid "We transfer all the data from CPU to GPU"
msgstr "全データを GPU に転送する。"

#: Advanced.md:44
msgid ""
"We instruct the GPU on the dimensions of the cells an of the _candidate "
"neighbors_ lists"
msgstr "Cell と _Candidate Neighbors_ の大きさを GPU に伝える。"

#: Advanced.md:46
msgid "On the GPU:"
msgstr "GPU 上："

#: Advanced.md:47
msgid "We load the shared memory"
msgstr "Shared Memory に読み込む。"

#: Advanced.md:48
msgid "We calculate the Coordination, \"as usual\""
msgstr "通常どおり Coordination を計算する。"

#: Advanced.md:49
msgid "Back on the CPU:"
msgstr "CPU に戻る："

#: Advanced.md:50
msgid ""
"We collect and we reduce coordination and virial, as we did in the "
"implementation example."
msgstr "基本実装と同様に、Coordination と Virial を回収して Reduction する。"

#: Advanced.md:52
msgid "Declaring some helpers"
msgstr "Helper の宣言"

#: Advanced.md:54
msgid ""
"We declare the classes we will use to setup and calculate the LinkCells:"
msgstr "LinkCells の設定・計算に使う Class を宣言します。"

#: Advanced.md:61
msgid "And we also setup the companion class:"
msgstr "補助 Class も用意します。"

#: Advanced.md:132
msgid ""
"this `cellSetup` is a trick class to pack all the cell index data used for "
"calculation the coordination in a single array. All of this data will be "
"passed to the GPU in with a single function call."
msgstr ""
"`cellSetup` は、Coordination に使う全 Cell Index を単一 Array にまとめる Class "
"です。1回の関数呼び出しで GPU に渡します。"

#: Advanced.md:134
msgid ""
"Below you will see a NL variable in a few places, it is defined like this:"
msgstr "以下の NL 変数は次の定義です。"

#: Advanced.md:143
msgid "Setting up the list of _candidate neighbors_"
msgstr "_Candidate Neighbors_ の設定"

#: Advanced.md:145
msgid "Note that here I removed all the MPI safeguard for clarity."
msgstr "明確にするため、MPI の安全確認を省いています。"

#: Advanced.md:147
msgid ""
"`LinkCells` must run on all the MPI processes, but the calculations usually "
"needs to run ONLY on a limited subset (1) of GPUs, so it is possible to run "
"the \"memory preparation\" instructions only on the main process."
msgstr ""
"`LinkCells` は全 MPI Process で実行する必要がありますが、計算は通常、限られた GPU（1つ）だけで行うため、Memory "
"準備は Main Process だけで行えます。"

#: Advanced.md:158
msgid "LinkCells needs the list of the indexes of the atoms:"
msgstr "LinkCells には Atom Index の一覧が必要です。"

#: Advanced.md:166
msgid ""
"We proceed with resetting the cells setup to update in which cell each atom "
"is:"
msgstr "Cell 設定を Reset し、各原子の所属 Cell を更新します。"

#: Advanced.md:186
msgid ""
"And lastly we take the cells informations and we prepare the list of indexes"
" to be tranferred on the GPU:"
msgstr "最後に Cell 情報を取得し、GPU に転送する Index 一覧を作ります。"

#: Advanced.md:208
msgid "`updateCellist` has the following shape:"
msgstr "`updateCellist` は次の形です。"

#: Advanced.md:226
msgid ""
"We are going to extract the data from the CellCollections into the "
"cellSetup, the two lists `nat_[InCells/otherAtoms]` store how long are the "
"rispective list of atoms (`atomsIncells` and `otherAtoms`)."
msgstr ""
"CellCollections から cellSetup にデータを抽出します。`nat_[InCells/otherAtoms]` "
"は各原子一覧（`atomsIncells`、`otherAtoms`）の長さです。"

#: Advanced.md:228
msgid ""
"The data within `otherAtoms` and `atomsIncells` is organized like this: "
"`c_0_id_0,c_0_id_1,...,c_0_id_N0` starting at position `0`, "
"`c_n_id_0,c_n_id_1,...,c_n_id_Nn` starting at position `n*(biggestCell or "
"maxNNExpected)`"
msgstr ""
"`otherAtoms` と `atomsIncells` は、位置 `0` から "
"`c_0_id_0,c_0_id_1,...,c_0_id_N0`、位置 `n*(biggestCell or maxNNExpected)` から "
"`c_n_id_0,c_n_id_1,...,c_n_id_Nn` という配置です。"

#: Advanced.md:231
msgid ""
"In this way, we only need to store the dimension of the sublist and not the "
"starting positions, that can be calculated when needed, this makes the "
"algorithm slighly easier to set up at a small cost in memory"
msgstr "開始位置は計算できるので、Sublist の長さだけ保存すればよく、少しの Memory コストで設定が簡単になります。"

#: Advanced.md:264
msgid "Moving the data on the GPU, and calling the kernel"
msgstr "GPU への転送と Kernel 呼び出し"

#: Advanced.md:266
msgid ""
"Then we finally move the atomic neighbors data stored in "
"`cellConfiguration_coord` on the GPU:"
msgstr "`cellConfiguration_coord` の Neighbor データを GPU に移します。"

#: Advanced.md:275
msgid ""
"We will pass the position of the data with the helper methods of `cellSetup`"
" we defined [above](#declaring-some-helpers)"
msgstr "[上記](#declaring-some-helpers) の `cellSetup` の Helper でデータ位置を渡します。"

#: Advanced.md:286
msgid "We can prepare for submitting the kernel:"
msgstr "Kernel の投入を準備します。"

#: Advanced.md:289
msgid "We set the number of parallel group to the number of cells"
msgstr "並列 Group 数を Cell 数にする。"

#: Advanced.md:295
msgid ""
"Each single group will run with a number of threads equal to the number of "
"atoms in the cell with more atoms"
msgstr "各 Group の Thread 数を、最多原子 Cell の原子数にする。"

#: Advanced.md:301
msgid ""
"We will work on the shared memory in chunks of data. We set the tiling size "
"based on the maximum allowed shared memory size. The `maxAtomsPerCell` has "
"been preempively determined by interrogating the CUDA API about the kernel."
msgstr ""
"Shared Memory をデータの Chunk 単位で使います。最大容量から Tile Size を決めます。`maxAtomsPerCell` は"
" CUDA API に Kernel 情報を問い合わせ、事前に求めています。"

#: Advanced.md:309
msgid ""
"And finally we determine the size of the necessary shared memory, that it is"
" proportional to the tile of _candidate neigbors_ atoms per iteration:"
msgstr "反復ごとの _Candidate Neighbors_ の Tile に比例する、必要な Shared Memory 容量を決めます。"

#: Advanced.md:316
msgid "And finally we can submit the kernel:"
msgstr "最後に Kernel を投入します。"

#: Advanced.md:342
msgid "The kernel"
msgstr "Kernel"

#: Advanced.md:344
msgid ""
"`calcType` is an helper class that hides the implementation details of the "
"_dual_/_self_ calculation, the switching function and the pbcs."
msgstr ""
"`calcType` は、_Dual_/_Self_ 計算、Switching Function、PBC の詳細を隠す Helper Class です。"

#: Advanced.md:365
msgid "We setup the calculations:"
msgstr "計算を準備します。"

#: Advanced.md:367
msgid ""
"We identify the current cell by detemining the block we are running in "
"(remember 1 cell = 1 block)"
msgstr "実行中の Block から現在の Cell を特定する（1 Cell = 1 Block）。"

#: Advanced.md:368
msgid ""
"We setup the shared memory from the allocated one (see [below](#appendix) "
"for the Arena)"
msgstr "確保した領域から Shared Memory を設定する（Arena は [後述](#appendix)）。"

#: Advanced.md:369
msgid ""
"We understand if this thread will partecipate in the calculations or only in"
" the memory loading"
msgstr "この Thread が計算にも参加するか、Memory 読み込みだけかを判定する。"

#: Advanced.md:370
msgid ""
"and from that we detemine which is the index of the atom on this thread"
msgstr "それに基づき、この Thread の Atom Index を決める。"

#: Advanced.md:371
msgid ""
"we setup some local memory (that should be allocated to register local to "
"the thread)"
msgstr "Local Memory を用意する（Thread の Register に置かれるはず）。"

#: Advanced.md:402
msgid "Then we start the true calculation:"
msgstr "実際の計算を始めます。"

#: Advanced.md:404
msgid ""
"All the thread in the group will collectively load part of the global memory"
" into the shared memory"
msgstr "Group の全 Thread で Global Memory の一部を Shared Memory に読み込む。"

#: Advanced.md:405
msgid ""
"Then the active threads will loop on the shared memory to calculate "
"coordination and derivatives"
msgstr "Active Thread が Shared Memory を Loop し、Coordination と微分を計算する。"

#: Advanced.md:406
msgid ""
"If the number of _candidate neighbors_ is not finished we go back to loading"
" data into the shared memory"
msgstr "_Candidate Neighbors_ が残っていれば、Shared Memory の読み込みに戻る。"

#: Advanced.md:408
msgid "We loop until we finished the _candidate neighbors_:"
msgstr "全 _Candidate Neighbors_ が終わるまで繰り返します。"

#: Advanced.md:414
msgid ""
"In each iteration we load the shared memory with the data from the global "
"memory. Note that in this first loop each thread will run on a subset of the"
" `tile_size` so that the effort of copying the the data is shared between "
"all the threads in the group"
msgstr ""
"各反復で Global から Shared Memory に読み込みます。この最初の Loop では、各 Thread が `tile_size` "
"の一部を担当し、Copy の負荷を Group 全体で分担します。"

#: Advanced.md:431
msgid ""
"The active threads will loop in the current loaded _candidate neighbors_, "
"then every thread will wait for all the other before iterating in the "
"subsequent memory loading (to avoid changing the values while the active "
"threads are still working on that data)."
msgstr ""
"Active Thread が読み込んだ _Candidate Neighbors_ を処理し、次の読み込み前に全 Thread "
"が待ち合わせます。処理中の値の変更を防ぎます。"

#: Advanced.md:455
msgid ""
"Finally we copy the result in the global array, like in the base example."
msgstr "最後に基本例と同様、結果を Global Array に Copy します。"

#: Advanced.md:477
msgid "Appendix"
msgstr "付録"

#: Advanced.md:478
msgid "Arena"
msgstr "Arena"

#: Advanced.md:479
msgid ""
"The `sharedArena` class copies the idea of the _arena allocator_ to assign "
"the shared memory data to specific types. The class is made up to not "
"overlap the suballocation on each other."
msgstr ""
"`sharedArena` は Arena Allocator の考えで Shared Memory "
"を各型に割り当て、部分的な確保が重ならないようにします。"

#: Advanced.md:495
msgid ""
"Here the \"arena\" concept is used on a chunk of memory that is already "
"allocatea and that will automatically be deallocated after the kernel has "
"finished its job. We are just using a toy version of the tecnique to treat "
"subsequent chunks of \"generically\" allocated memory as if it of a certain "
"type."
msgstr "ここでは、既に確保済みで Kernel 終了後に自動解放される領域を使います。汎用的に確保した連続領域を特定の型として扱う、簡単な例です。"

#: Advanced.md:497
msgid ""
"The standard Arena allocator tecnique is more complex and aims at managing "
"the memory with minimizing the number of `malloc` and `free` used. In a few "
"words you allocate a big chunk of memory once and then you manage it by "
"assigning part of it to different array or other structures, then the point "
"become that you can reutilize the already allocated memory without asking "
"for new allocation or deallocation. You just need to apply some more care in"
" what you are asking doing with the initialization of the date and "
"expecially in avoinding the reutilization of old pointers."
msgstr ""
"標準的な Arena Allocator はより複雑で、`malloc` と `free` の回数を減らします。大きな領域を1回確保し、Array "
"や構造に分配して再利用するため、新たな確保・解放が不要になります。データの初期化と、古い Pointer の再利用を避けることに注意が必要です。"
